I opened a draft here to show you how it could look like: https://github.com/Lightning-AI/pytorch-lightning/pull/19444. The idea is that we could provide a simple page that shows how to get started, and then the full wandb-specific apis would be documented externally on the wandb page.

Let me know what you think and feel free to take my draft and tweak it.
